#. translators: %d: number of Highcharts charts
#: components/class-m-chart-admin.php:517
msgid ""
"The M Chart Highcharts Library is deprecated and will not receive further "
"updates. You have %d chart built with it."
msgid_plural ""
"The M Chart Highcharts Library is deprecated and will not receive further "
"updates. You have %d charts built with it."
msgstr[0] ""
"M Chart Highcharts ライブラリは非推奨となっており、今後の更新は行われません。"
"このライブラリを使用して作成されたチャートは %d 個あります。"

#. translators: %d: number of Highcharts charts
#: components/class-m-chart-admin.php:530
msgid ""
"You have %d chart built with the Highcharts library, which is not active — "
"that chart currently won't display. The M Chart Highcharts Library is "
"deprecated and will not receive further updates."
msgid_plural ""
"You have %d charts built with the Highcharts library, which is not active — "
"those charts currently won't display. The M Chart Highcharts Library is "
"deprecated and will not receive further updates."
msgstr[0] ""
"Highcharts ライブラリを使用して作成された %d 個のチャートがありますが、これら"
"は有効になっていません。そのため、現在これらのチャートは表示されません。M "
"Chart Highcharts ライブラリは非推奨となっており、今後の更新は行われません。"

#: components/class-m-chart-admin.php:543
msgid ""
"You can migrate them to Chart.js with one click. The M Chart implementation "
"of Chart.js now matches Highcharts feature-for-feature, supports additional "
"chart types, works with M Chart Pro, is more performant, and isn't burdened "
"by expensive commercial licensing requirements."
msgstr ""
"ワンクリックでChart.jsへ移行できます。Chart.jsのM Chart実装は、現在Highcharts"
"と機能面で完全に同等であり、追加のチャートタイプに対応し、M Chart Proとの連携"
"も可能で、パフォーマンスも向上しており、高額な商用ライセンスの要件に縛られる"
"こともありません。"

